# Every race's content, in one add-on.
#
# Ship INTERIORS - one ASCII floor plan per hull, see sbs_utils/GRID_ASCII_FORMAT.md - and
# FLEET LADDERS, the ships that make up a raiding fleet at each difficulty.
#
# One add-on rather than one per race, because the per-race control already lives in the
# SETTINGS below: splitting the package too only made every mission list nine mastlibs
# instead of one, without granting anything the settings did not already give.
#
# Two gates, because they answer different questions:
#   PLAYABLE_RACES - whose ship interiors load. An interior is only ever built for a
#                    PLAYER ship, so plans for a race nobody can fly are parsed and unused.
#   NPC_RACES      - whose fleet ladders load. A race with no ladder cannot be spawned as
#                    a fleet and is not picked by "random".
#
# The hull outline in each floor plan is the ENGINE's own is_grid_point_open, captured by
# the LM_TestRange "PROBE hull map" map. Regenerate rather than hand-editing an outline;
# the rooms inside it are yours to move.
provides races


# ---- TSN -----------------------------------------------------------
if settings_race_is_playable("TSN"):
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_battle_cruiser.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_battleship.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_bomber.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_carrier.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_destroyer.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_dreadnought.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_escort.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_fighter.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_heavy_cruiser.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_juggernaut.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_light_carrier.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_light_cruiser.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_mine_layer.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_missile_cruiser.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_scout.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_shuttle.grid"), "races")
    grid_merge_ascii(media_read_relative_file("tsn_warpster.grid"), "races")

